abstract: >-
  Crawler, analysis, figure and paper sources, ConsentCheck (a merchant self-test) and the pseudonymized data of a
  measurement of whether consent choices (no click, Decline, Global Privacy Control) govern the advertising pixels that
  Shopify runs in sandboxed web workers and iframes, on Shopify storefronts from the Tranco top 1M crawled from
  California in September 2026, with a pilot on Wix, BigCommerce and first-party tag gateways. The code is MIT
  licensed (LICENSE); data, figures and documents are CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-DATA).
keywords:
  - web tracking
  - consent management platform
  - cookie banner
  - Global Privacy Control
  - Shopify
  - web pixel
  - sandboxing
  - web measurement
